{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかですお久しぶりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新なくてさびしかった⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく会ってないけどもね、\nみなさんからのコメントで\nすんごい元気いっぱいもらってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーーーーーっと\n会いたいなぁ\nて思ってます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、よみうりランドの全国握手会は\nどうでしたか⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もにぎにぎしたかったなああああぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今すぐ私とぎゅーしてくださいー\nみなさんが不足してますー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーノー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『左胸の勇気』初披露\n本当に出演したかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一曲だけでもいいから\n遊園地にぴゅんと飛んで\n歌って踊りたかったですx("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんのブログの写真を見ましたが、\n会場がめっちゃ広くて...\n人もたっくさん‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のために沢山の人が集まっていただいて、\n本当にうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代役をやってくれた\nひなちま本当にありがとう＊\nみんな、協力してくれてありがとう＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもメンバーには\nお世話になるし迷惑をかけるかもしれないけど、\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーだいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の全国握手会in大阪\n気合い入れてがんばるっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも更新しまくるんで\n楽しみにしててくださいねー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日中にまた更新するかもしれない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/06/0599122/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CHuu"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}